Qore openldap Module Release Notes
===================================

For detailed release notes including all version history, please see the
module documentation generated by Doxygen in the "Release Notes" section:

    docs/mainpage.doxygen.tmpl

Or view the generated HTML documentation after building with:

    cmake .. && make docs

The release notes are maintained in the Doxygen documentation to ensure
a single source of truth and proper formatting in the generated API docs.
